WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:07.825
Did your mom find any work yet?

00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:10.240
She just needs a little help, that's all.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.640
I've been saving up my money for a real long time

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:18.980
There you go, baby

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.820
Thanks, Bear

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.300
It's looking like I can leave pretty soon

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.580
So who's the new guy?

00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:28.225
Bruno?

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:31.135
Why, you got a thing for him?

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.440
I don't know, maybe?

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.920
Do you believe in love at first sight?

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:38.060
No.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.440
I do.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.200
You're perfect, Bruno

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.740
She making you pay for it?

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:45.680
What?

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.200
[Spits] You heard me.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.220
Don't touch me.

00:00:54.645 --> 00:00:55.645
[Knocks] Bruno?

00:00:58.205 --> 00:01:00.555
I didn't get my rent. Next time, you're out.

00:01:02.915 --> 00:01:04.035
Here, you want a ride?

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.320
I just think people need to learn to appreciate things more.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.100
I didn't want to!

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.800
But you did! You did!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.780
Cause if you look at it in a certain way,

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.900
life is just so amazing.

